<DATA=Code>
  2009-01-01 12:00  => IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-4 archive work (MT-050): one ARCHISEPARE for every call. Key
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* lengths, key offset, record length and names come from the
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SGSPARM file written by the skeleton hand-off; behaviour as in
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* Conversion\Pipeline\Generic\ARCHISEPARE\spec.md (source:
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-Source\ARCHISEPARE, UCS COBOL).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SGSPARM (250): KY<k1 5><offset 5><k2 5><rsz 5>
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>*                TN<base 6><table 30>  FN<archi 30><narchi 30>
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* Keys up to 18 digits, rsz up to 3968 (32 + rsz <= 4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROGRAM-ID. 'ASSURFED-UTILIT-ARCHISEPARE-GN'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CONFIGURATION SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SOURCE-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => OBJECT-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE-CONTROL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT PARMF ASSIGN TO DISC SGSPARM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FKEY ASSIGN TO DISC ARCKEY.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FUNL ASSIGN TO DISC ARCUNL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FARC ASSIGN TO DISC ARCOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FNAR ASSIGN TO DISC ARCNOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DATA DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  PARMF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-TYPE         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-REST         PIC X(248).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-KY-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-K1          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-OFF         PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-K2          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PK-RSZ         PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(228).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-TN-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PT-BASE        PIC X(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PT-TABLE       PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(212).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-FN-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PN-ARCHI       PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  PN-NARCHI      PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(188).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FKEY
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-KEY-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FKEY-REC PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FUNL
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-UNL-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FUNL-REC PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FARC
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FARC-REC PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FNAR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FNAR-REC PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  RECIN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-KEYREC          PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-UNL             PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-OUT             PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  KEY-C-X            PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  KEY-C-N REDEFINES KEY-C-X PIC 9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  KEY-U-X            PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  KEY-U-N REDEFINES KEY-U-X PIC 9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-KEY-LEN         PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-UNL-LEN         PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-K1               PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-OFF              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-K2               PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-RSZ              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-KST              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-KSU              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-KSC              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-DON              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CP-LEN             PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-BASE             PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-TABLE            PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-ARCHI            PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-NARCHI           PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  LECRCHF            PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  LECUNLOADF         PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPTLU              PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPTARCHI           PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPTNARCHI          PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPTLUF             PIC Z(6)9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPTARCHIF          PIC Z(6)9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CPTNARCHIF         PIC Z(6)9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  LIGNE-TYPE9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  CD-DON9        PIC X VALUE '9'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NM-BAS9        PIC X(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NM-TAB9        PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  DT-ACH9        PIC X(8).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  CPTACH1        PIC S9(11) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  CPTACH2        PIC S9(11) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  DATE-I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  ANNEE-I        PIC 9(4).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  MOIS-I         PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  JOUR-I         PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  DATE-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  JOUR-FR        PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X VALUE '/'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  MOIS-FR        PIC 99.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X VALUE '/'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  ANNEE-FR       PIC 9(4).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-MSG             PIC X(80).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-PTR             PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ PARMF AT END GO TO PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'KY'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-K1 TO P-K1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-OFF TO P-OFF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-K2 TO P-K2
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PK-RSZ TO P-RSZ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'TN'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PT-BASE TO P-BASE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PT-TABLE TO P-TABLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'FN'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PN-ARCHI TO P-ARCHI
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE PN-NARCHI TO P-NARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-KST = P-OFF + 1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-KSU = 19 - P-K2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-KSC = 19 - P-K1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE P-DON = 3 + P-K2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT FKEY FUNL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN OUTPUT FARC FNAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM LEC-KEY THRU LEC-KEY-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM LEC-UNL THRU LEC-UNL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* 102-SEPARE: sorted key match, as in the source.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SEPARE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF LECUNLOADF = 1 GO TO TYPE9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF LECRCHF = 1 GO TO NARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF KEY-C-N = KEY-U-N GO TO ARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF KEY-C-N > KEY-U-N GO TO NARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM LEC-KEY THRU LEC-KEY-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO SEPARE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE '4A' TO WS-OUT (1:2).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE KEY-U-X (P-KSU:P-K2) TO WS-OUT (3:P-K2).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL (1:P-RSZ) TO WS-OUT (P-DON:P-RSZ).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE FARC-REC FROM WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO CPTARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM LEC-UNL THRU LEC-UNL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF KEY-U-N NOT = KEY-C-N
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        PERFORM LEC-KEY THRU LEC-KEY-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO SEPARE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => NARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL (1:P-RSZ) TO WS-OUT (1:P-RSZ).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE FNAR-REC FROM WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO CPTNARCHI.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM LEC-UNL THRU LEC-UNL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO SEPARE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* Type-9 trailer: 69 bytes, cut at the record length (32 + rsz)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* by the runtime, as WRITE FROM cuts it in the source.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => TYPE9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE P-BASE TO NM-BAS9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE P-TABLE TO NM-TAB9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ACCEPT DATE-I FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE DATE-I TO DT-ACH9.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPTARCHI TO CPTACH1 CPTACH2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE LIGNE-TYPE9 TO WS-OUT (1:69).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE FARC-REC FROM WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ANNEE-I TO ANNEE-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE MOIS-I TO MOIS-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE JOUR-I TO JOUR-FR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPTLU TO CPTLUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPTARCHI TO CPTARCHIF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE CPTNARCHI TO CPTNARCHIF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'Archisepare              Rapport             '
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       DATE-FR UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY ' ' UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'Enregistrement lu : ' CPTLUF UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STRING 'Enregistrement ecrit dans ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>            P-ARCHI DELIMITED BY SPACE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>            ' : ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       INTO WS-MSG WITH POINTER WS-PTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-PTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY WS-MSG (1:WS-PTR) CPTARCHIF UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-MSG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STRING 'Enregistrement ecrit dans ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>            P-NARCHI DELIMITED BY SPACE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>            ' : ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       INTO WS-MSG WITH POINTER WS-PTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-PTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY WS-MSG (1:WS-PTR) CPTNARCHIF UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE FKEY FUNL FARC FNAR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* 100-LEC-CHERCHEUSE: the key as a number (PIC 9 compare).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LEC-KEY.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FKEY INTO RECIN AT END
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO LECRCHF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO LEC-KEY-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEYREC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-KEY-LEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > P-K1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-K1 TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE RECIN (1:CP-LEN) TO WS-KEYREC (1:CP-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL '0' TO KEY-C-X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-KEYREC (1:P-K1) TO KEY-C-X (P-KSC:P-K1).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LEC-KEY-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* 101-LEC-UNLOAD: the record padded to rsz, and its key.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LEC-UNL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FUNL INTO RECIN AT END
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO LECUNLOADF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO LEC-UNL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO CPTLU.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-UNL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL-LEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > P-RSZ
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-RSZ TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE RECIN (1:CP-LEN) TO WS-UNL (1:CP-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL '0' TO KEY-U-X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-UNL (P-KST:P-K2) TO KEY-U-X (P-KSU:P-K2).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LEC-UNL-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
</DATA>
<DATA=Documentation>
  -MAP-
  Documentation
  * SSG-4 archive work (MT-050): one ARCHISEPARE for every call. Key
  * lengths, key offset, record length and names come from the
  * SGSPARM file written by the skeleton hand-off; behaviour as in
  * Conversion\Pipeline\Generic\ARCHISEPARE\spec.md (source:
  * SSG-Source\ARCHISEPARE, UCS COBOL).
  * SGSPARM (250): KY<k1 5><offset 5><k2 5><rsz 5>
  *                TN<base 6><table 30>  FN<archi 30><narchi 30>
  * Keys up to 18 digits, rsz up to 3968 (32 + rsz <= 4000).
  PROGRAM-ID. .
  -MAPEND-
